{"_meta":{"securitySchemes":[{"scopes":["billing:checkout"],"type":"oauth2"}]},"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":true,"readOnlyHint":false},"description":"Create a private Stripe checkout for a current offer after the user expresses purchase intent. Explain price, duration and annual renewal before proceeding. This tool does not charge a card: give checkoutUrl privately to the buyer for payment authorization. Reuse the exact requestId/input after uncertainty; never create a replacement checkout to retry. Pro and Studio passes accept months=1\u201312 and never auto-renew; annual offers are recurring. Requires billing:checkout.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"months":{"maximum":12,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"offerId":{"enum":["pro_week","pro","studio","pro_annual","studio_annual"],"type":"string"},"requestId":{"pattern":"^[A-Za-z0-9_-]{8,128}$","type":"string"}},"required":["requestId","offerId"],"type":"object"},"name":"create_checkout","outputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"amountCents":{"type":"integer"},"checkoutStatus":{"enum":["creating","open","complete","expired"],"type":"string"},"checkoutUrl":{"type":["string","null"]},"currency":{"const":"USD","type":"string"},"fulfillmentStatus":{"enum":["pending","fulfilled"],"type":"string"},"id":{"type":"string"},"months":{"type":"integer"},"offerId":{"enum":["pro_week","pro","studio","pro_annual","studio_annual"],"type":"string"},"paymentStatus":{"enum":["pending","unpaid","paid","no_payment_required"],"type":"string"}},"required":["id","offerId","months","amountCents","currency","checkoutUrl","checkoutStatus","paymentStatus","fulfillmentStatus"],"type":"object"},"title":"Start an authorized purchase"}
